    ["Explodes after a delay, dealing [StandardDamage(4,1)] [School()] damage.\n\n[StandardAccuracy(4,1)] |cffffffffHit Chance|r"] = "Вибухає після затримки, завдаючи [StandardDamage(4,1)] шкоди [School()].\n\n[StandardAccuracy(4,1)] |cffffffffШанс влучити|r",
